# The COS dashboard stream each agent session's model spend is tagged with (scripts/agent-session), by working
# directory. Values: oss-verify, verified-linux, task-making, verified-grader, rocq-speed, lean-speed, legion,
# infra-monitoring; agent-process for the chief of staff, librarian, explainer and box housekeeping; Sami's own
# non-Theorem work under its own name (omp, pivot); `shared` only when nothing is known.
# GLOB PROJECT [SUBPROJECT]; the first glob that matches the session's working directory wins, so a specific glob
# goes before a general one that also matches it. This map is only the fallback: THEOREM_PROJECT, then the
# resumed session's own ~/.config/agent-spend/sessions/<id>, come first; no match here: the machine's
# ~/.config/agent-spend/default-project, else `shared`.
*/oss-verifier*                 oss-verify
*/oss-verify*                   oss-verify
*/machcsl-riscv*                verified-linux
*/agent-infra*                  legion
*/binary-equivalence*           task-making
*/rocq-speed*                   rocq-speed
*/speed-lane-*                  rocq-speed
*/src/speed-*                   rocq-speed
*/speed-loop*                   rocq-speed
*/nvme/sami/tmp/speedcoach*     rocq-speed
*/nvme/sami/gate*               rocq-speed
*/lean-build-perf*              lean-speed
*/xv6*                          task-making
*/Code/personal/theorem*        verified-grader
*/legion*                       legion
*/Code/legion*                  legion
*/nvme/sami/chief*              agent-process
*/nvme/sami/librarian*          agent-process
*/nvme/sami/explainer*          agent-process
